# note: MSKCC Lilac, cpuqueue: CPU only, no GPU, 8 slots, 6 hours. Lilac has no
#       CPU-only nodes; cpuqueue runs on the free cores of the GPU hosts. 6 h is
#       the most the lab-owned host pools lend out (DURATION[360]), so a longer
#       walltime shuts those hosts out.
--scheduler
lsf
--queue
cpuqueue
--cores
8
--walltime
6h
